<title>POLAND: WBK SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 14.39 MLN.</title>
<headline>WBK SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 14.39 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 14.39 vs   15.37</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   17.15 vs   27.20</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 36.63 vs   31.12</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	65.31 vs   57.99</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					120.96 vs   85.94</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  178.77 vs  143.66</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		320.52 vs  264.86</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     594.60 vs  498.04</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Wielkopolski Bank</p>
<p>Kredytowy SA. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
